      <marc:subfield code="a">Spark your Dream is a true Story of personal inspiration that explrores the inconveniences and the solutions that are presented at the beginning of a dream. Through this incredible journey the reader will live the risk, the sensation of freedom, the passion, the pain of a death, the birth of a son, frustration, life, and succes. And surely, upon getting to the destination you won&apos;t like to stop, but you will have to do like Herman and Cande did upon arrival in Alaska. And you&apos;ll get there moved to tears and jump with them celebrating, knowing that dreams are possible if one day you begin.</marc:subfield>
